{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/poster

    The poster of an event, to print: the centre, the event, the QR that opens the sign-up and its link.

    Example context (json):
    {"centre": "Colegio de ejemplo", "event": "Jornada de puertas abiertas", "when": "sábado, 21 de noviembre, 10:00",
     "qr": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"></svg>", "link": "https://example.com/j"}
}}
<div class="eguahe-poster">
    <p class="eguahe-poster-centre">{{centre}}</p>
    <h1>{{event}}</h1>
    <p class="eguahe-poster-when">{{when}}</p>
    <div class="eguahe-qr">{{{qr}}}</div>
    <p class="eguahe-poster-link">{{link}}</p>
</div>
